    <string name="aa_own_copy_body">FT installed Android Auto, so it starts by itself when the car connects. Keep it updated from the Play Store, as Google stops older versions from working.</string>
    <string name="aa_server_option">Android Auto\'s head unit server</string>
    <string name="aa_server_option_body">FT starts Android Auto on the car through this server. It is quick to switch on in Android Auto\'s settings, but Android Auto switches it off again when the phone restarts or Android Auto updates.</string>
